# Synapse RiskOps — Full Tool Integration Implementation Plan

## Project Overview

Synapse RiskOps is an **autonomous incident operations platform** that detects server/website overloads and errors, diagnoses root causes via a GenAI-powered LangGraph pipeline, and either auto-remediates or escalates to engineers with a generated ticket. This plan covers integrating all requested tools into a production-ready, verifiable system.

